          <tr><td><a href="https://www.fns.usda.gov/snap/broad-based-categorical-eligibility" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">USDA FNS: Broad-based categorical eligibility</a></td><td>State asset-test and gross income variations</td></tr>
