        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="snp-independence">Seniors Audit is an independent educational site and is not affiliated with USDA or any government agency. For the work-rule summary and the immigration summary we also cite <a href="https://www.elderlawanswers.com/new-snap-work-requirements-will-now-affect-more-older-adults-21428" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ElderLawAnswers</a> and the <a href="https://www.nycfoodpolicy.org/snap-new-rules-2025/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NYC Food Policy Center</a>, which summarize the law in plain language.</p>
  </section>

  <p class="ctx-links"><strong>Keep going:</strong> If you are checking benefits, health coverage matters too. The <a href="/tools/medicare-vs-medicaid-calculator/">Medicare vs Medicaid calculator</a> shows which program you may qualify for, and the <a href="/tools/extra-help-eligibility-calculator/">Extra Help calculator</a> checks help with prescription costs.</p>

